  {
    "question": "请用一个生活中的简单例子解释变量赋值和数学等式的区别。",
    "seconds": 8.039,
    "turn": {
      "turn_id": "answer-70afbcb6980b4ed3abc1bf9135d0e935",
      "session_id": "learning-b7e3703e5cbe795d946b303899ea561e04e3a0a8e2f83ec1ddeefdbdf4156bd1",
      "request_id": "b8e725e5-6133-4554-93fd-026d6e35649e",
      "topic_id": "a",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "stage": "succeeded",
      "attempt": 1,
      "result": {
        "actions": [],
        "citations": [
          {
            "title": "Python变量与赋值",
            "locator": null,
            "visibility": "course",
            "citation_id": "ctx_01",
            "content_hash": "9cba80175b57cf3831fc25eb07774ec5194614a80b386d3aafdb87ea2cdba60a",
            "resource_ref": {
              "version": 2,
              "course_id": "learning-fixture",
              "material_id": "a-core",
              "material_type": "report"
            }
          }
        ],
        "observation": null,
        "citation_ids": [
          "ctx_01"
        ],
        "memory_epoch": 0,
        "model_rounds": 1,
        "role_version": "learning-role-v1",
        "tool_attempts": 0,
        "answer_markdown": "用「储物盒」来理解：\n\n**变量赋值**像给盒子贴标签、放东西。\n- `x = 1`：往盒子里放一个苹果，盒子叫 x。\n- `x = 2`：把苹果换成梨，盒子还是 x，但里面东西变了。\n- `y = x`：再拿一个盒子 y，让它指向 x 现在装的东西（同一个梨），不是复制一个梨。\n\n**数学等式**则像天平，左右必须永远相等。\n- `x = 1` 在数学里是「x 就等于 1」这个事实，不能过一会儿又说 `x = 2`，否则就矛盾了。\n\n一句话：赋值是「把东西放进盒子」的动作，可以反复换；等式是「两边相等」的陈述，不能自相矛盾。",
        "source_revision": 0,
        "preparation_receipts": [],
        "suggested_action_ids": []
      },
      "error_code": null,
      "committed_effects": []
    }
  },
